WEBVTT

01:43.645 --> 01:44.479
EPISODE 2: PRISONER FE40536: JOLYNE CUJOH

01:44.562 --> 01:45.396
Welcome, inmates.

01:45.980 --> 01:49.317
I am the warden of
Green Dolphin Street State Prison,

01:49.400 --> 01:50.985
Locobaroco.

01:51.069 --> 01:54.489
And this lovely crocodile here

01:54.572 --> 01:56.533
is Charlotte, my assistant.

01:56.616 --> 01:57.909
Great to meet you!

01:59.327 --> 02:00.286
Charlotte,

02:00.370 --> 02:05.458
please explain how life is
in this institution.

02:05.542 --> 02:06.459
Okay!

02:07.043 --> 02:08.545
Similar to the United States,

02:08.628 --> 02:12.173
this prison is based on
the concept of freedom and equality.

02:12.757 --> 02:15.927
You may freely walk around the facility

02:16.010 --> 02:17.679
and exercise as you please.

02:18.179 --> 02:21.099
You may use the phones,
the shower, and the library as well.

02:21.808 --> 02:24.269
If you are an exemplary inmate,
you may even own a TV.

02:24.352 --> 02:28.398
You could also work or study
and earn university credits.

02:28.940 --> 02:30.525
That's right.

02:31.568 --> 02:33.820
Yes! What is it, Charlotte?

02:33.903 --> 02:37.365
But Warden, there are rules too, right?

02:37.448 --> 02:39.450
You're absolutely correct, Charlotte!

02:40.285 --> 02:45.165
First, do not remove the wristband
with your inmate number.

02:45.748 --> 02:48.626
No lending or borrowing of items
between inmates.

02:48.710 --> 02:50.920
No possession of metal objects.

02:51.004 --> 02:52.839
How about earrings?

02:52.922 --> 02:55.341
The warden's still speaking! Shut up!

02:56.885 --> 03:01.514
Earrings are prohibited,
FE40536, Jolyne Cujoh.

03:01.598 --> 03:05.310
Feel free to ask any questions
to the prison guards.

03:05.393 --> 03:07.312
You are now dismissed.

03:07.395 --> 03:10.773
All right! Everyone, face left!

03:11.858 --> 03:13.651
It's so spacious.

03:13.735 --> 03:16.029
The entire island is the prison.

03:16.112 --> 03:17.739
Oh, a crocodile.

03:29.709 --> 03:31.628
FE40536.

03:32.212 --> 03:35.131
Cell 206 will be your home from now on.

03:39.636 --> 03:41.804
Today's free time is over.

03:42.430 --> 03:44.265
The cells open at 6:30 a.m.

03:44.849 --> 03:48.686
Breakfast begins at seven,
but you may choose to sleep in.

03:50.313 --> 03:51.773
Try to get along now.

03:55.652 --> 03:56.486
Nice to meet you.

03:56.986 --> 03:58.780
Nice to meet you too.

03:58.863 --> 04:00.323
I'm Jolyne.

04:00.406 --> 04:01.699
I'm Gwess.

04:01.783 --> 04:02.825
Want some?

04:02.909 --> 04:03.868
Thanks.

04:04.494 --> 04:07.163
But I don't have an appetite.
There's so much to get used to--

04:09.749 --> 04:12.126
Ouch! What the hell--

04:12.210 --> 04:14.587
The bottom bunk is mine!

04:14.671 --> 04:17.799
You got a problem with that, you bitch?

04:25.723 --> 04:27.642
I didn't mean to instigate a fight.

04:28.309 --> 04:31.271
I just misunderstood since
your things were on the top bunk.

04:33.898 --> 04:35.275
That charm!

04:36.150 --> 04:37.360
Bitch!

04:37.443 --> 04:39.320
Get your dirty hands off of my stuff!

04:39.404 --> 04:40.989
Can I see that charm?

04:41.072 --> 04:45.952
There should be a small stone
and a photograph of my parents inside!

04:46.744 --> 04:48.204
It could have belonged to me!

04:49.289 --> 04:52.750
I bought it for two dollars
from a newcomer the other day.

04:52.834 --> 04:54.627
Because it's just so beautiful.

04:54.711 --> 04:56.254
Let me see it!

04:56.337 --> 04:59.340
You better watch your mouth, ugly!

05:01.759 --> 05:03.261
Okay, I'll buy it off of you.

05:03.344 --> 05:05.054
How much do you want?

05:05.138 --> 05:06.222
Two hundred dollars.

05:06.306 --> 05:07.265
What?

05:07.348 --> 05:10.310
You heard me, dumbass. I said 200 dollars.

05:10.393 --> 05:11.227
You bitch…

05:19.277 --> 05:20.778
Lights out!

05:31.914 --> 05:32.915
What's going on?

05:33.624 --> 05:35.626
Too much is happening all at once.

05:39.589 --> 05:41.382
I have so much to think about.

05:44.135 --> 05:47.138
I'm so sad that I'm starting to cry.

05:58.066 --> 06:00.109
What the hell?

06:00.193 --> 06:02.487
I'm sorry. About last night, I mean.

06:02.570 --> 06:03.696
What?

06:05.198 --> 06:06.032
It's morning.

06:07.784 --> 06:08.618
Here.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.789
You can look at it.

06:12.872 --> 06:13.915
But…

06:14.749 --> 06:16.501
There was nothing inside it.

06:16.584 --> 06:18.878
No pictures, no nothing.

06:18.961 --> 06:19.879
See?

06:22.673 --> 06:25.218
Was there anything else in it?
Like a stone?

06:25.301 --> 06:26.886
No. Nothing.

06:27.512 --> 06:30.306
Anyway, please forgive
my behavior last night.

06:31.057 --> 06:34.727
I'm shy around new people.

06:35.311 --> 06:39.273
Oh, there's nothing to forgive.
It was my fault.

06:40.066 --> 06:41.734
I don't know the rules around here yet.

06:42.610 --> 06:44.862
Jolyne, you are a good person.

06:45.446 --> 06:46.823
Let's be friends from now on.

06:47.615 --> 06:48.950
Yes, I'd like that.

06:52.286 --> 06:54.872
Anyway, it's breakfast time.

06:54.956 --> 06:56.040
I'll see you there.

06:56.791 --> 06:58.376
Hold on, I'll go with you.

07:00.420 --> 07:01.587
What the hell?

07:01.671 --> 07:03.214
There's water all over the place!

07:04.590 --> 07:07.343
My pants are soaking wet. This sucks!

07:15.017 --> 07:17.854
What do you mean it's "sold out"?

07:17.937 --> 07:19.605
I haven't eaten yet.

07:19.689 --> 07:20.940
As you can see,

07:21.023 --> 07:23.025
you're free to sleep in.

07:23.109 --> 07:24.944
You're also free to get here late.

07:25.027 --> 07:27.029
Isn't there food for everyone?

07:27.113 --> 07:29.073
Any leftover milk or bananas?

07:29.657 --> 07:31.784
That's the strange thing about prisons.

07:31.868 --> 07:33.035
That makes no sense!

07:33.619 --> 07:35.788
Oh, Jolyne, you took your sweet time.

07:36.289 --> 07:38.332
I'm so full.

07:41.752 --> 07:42.962
Hey, Gwess.

07:43.045 --> 07:45.965
You had two milk cartons and two bananas!

07:46.048 --> 07:47.091
Two bananas?

07:47.175 --> 07:49.469
No way. Are you still asleep?

07:49.552 --> 07:53.055
Also, sorry about the water.
I accidentally spilled it.

07:53.139 --> 07:54.932
I'll clean it up later.

07:55.016 --> 07:56.559
I already cleaned it off.

07:56.642 --> 07:58.269
Oh, thank you.

07:58.352 --> 07:59.896
You're so kind, Jolyne.

08:05.067 --> 08:06.068
This is…

08:13.910 --> 08:16.370
Jump for me. I believe in you.

08:16.454 --> 08:18.539
I love you,

08:18.623 --> 08:20.875
and you love me.

08:20.958 --> 08:23.836
Don't we trust one another?

08:25.463 --> 08:26.839
Do it for me.

08:31.427 --> 08:33.888
Good boy!

08:33.971 --> 08:38.601
Aren't you an adorable little birdie?

08:38.684 --> 08:41.354
Good job! Here's your reward!

08:41.437 --> 08:43.105
Good morning!

08:44.899 --> 08:46.859
No, Pi-chan.

08:46.943 --> 08:48.319
Not "good morning."

08:48.903 --> 08:50.071
Say "I love you."

08:50.154 --> 08:53.783
You're such a darling
when you say that you love me.

08:54.367 --> 08:55.201
I love you!

08:55.284 --> 08:57.453
Good boy!

08:57.537 --> 09:00.206
You're such a good boy, Pi-chan!

09:00.998 --> 09:02.708
Next, perch.

09:03.251 --> 09:04.377
Jump over.

09:04.961 --> 09:08.839
Taking risks is part
of trust-building, Pi-chan.

09:08.923 --> 09:09.924
What?

09:10.841 --> 09:12.635
Come on, jump!

09:14.929 --> 09:15.763
Whoa…

09:16.347 --> 09:18.516
What did you just say? "Whoa"?

09:19.517 --> 09:20.601
Say that again!

09:21.102 --> 09:23.187
Do birds go "whoa"?

09:25.106 --> 09:27.358
I love you! I love you! I love you!

09:27.441 --> 09:29.527
You're covering it up now, aren't you?

09:30.027 --> 09:32.905
You think such a blatant lie works on me?

09:32.989 --> 09:34.699
Do you?

09:36.993 --> 09:38.119
I've had it with you.

09:38.953 --> 09:39.996
We're through.

09:43.791 --> 09:45.459
What was that?

09:47.962 --> 09:48.796
A banana?

09:55.219 --> 09:57.221
What is this?

10:10.192 --> 10:12.111
Though it's tiny,

10:12.612 --> 10:13.863
it's definitely real.

10:16.157 --> 10:17.575
That woman…

10:18.993 --> 10:20.328
had already killed it!

10:39.096 --> 10:41.265
What is she doing?

10:43.559 --> 10:46.103
I knew it, she must have used that charm

10:46.187 --> 10:49.231
to gain some sort of ability!

10:49.315 --> 10:51.859
Where did she get that tiny human?

11:02.411 --> 11:03.245
What…

11:04.455 --> 11:05.915
happened to me?

11:10.878 --> 11:12.880
STAND NAME: G.G. DOLLS
STAND MASTER: GWESS

11:13.589 --> 11:15.299
This is…

11:15.800 --> 11:17.802
My body shrank!

11:17.885 --> 11:19.970
I knew it was you.

11:23.015 --> 11:25.434
How did you snatch away my Pi-chan?

11:27.478 --> 11:32.900
Jolyne!

11:35.403 --> 11:36.362
Jolyne.

11:36.946 --> 11:40.741
I'm starting to like you, really.

11:41.242 --> 11:42.827
What happened to my body?

11:42.910 --> 11:43.994
Explain!

11:44.078 --> 11:47.164
Listen, Jolyne. Please don't talk.

11:47.248 --> 11:48.916
The person inside that parrot--

11:48.999 --> 11:51.919
Hey, I said no talking!

11:53.421 --> 11:54.338
Get in it.

11:55.297 --> 11:57.425
I removed its guts.

11:58.008 --> 11:59.802
There was a flaw to using a parrot.

11:59.885 --> 12:02.888
Birds can't use their arms
and they can't grab.

12:02.972 --> 12:05.850
Rats, though, have front paws.

12:06.684 --> 12:10.187
He was a prison guard
who got fired for slacking off.

12:10.688 --> 12:12.648
The warden thinks he left the facility.

12:16.527 --> 12:19.238
Also, I told you to keep quiet.

12:19.321 --> 12:21.741
But if you can mimic
a rat squeak, I'll let it pass.

12:22.241 --> 12:25.619
You can say, "I'm going, squeak!"
or "I'm hungry, squeak!"

12:25.703 --> 12:27.455
Got it?

12:29.331 --> 12:31.584
Just as I thought, you look darling!

12:32.168 --> 12:33.919
Now it's time for training.

12:35.713 --> 12:37.465
Go, faster. Run!

12:39.592 --> 12:40.926
No slowing down.

12:44.096 --> 12:46.390
Lift, Chorokichi.

12:46.474 --> 12:47.975
Chorokichi?

12:48.058 --> 12:49.685
Everything has a name.

12:50.436 --> 12:53.063
The Word was with God,

12:53.147 --> 12:56.025
and all things were created by the Word.

12:56.108 --> 13:01.989
That's why I named this power
that shrank your size.

13:02.072 --> 13:03.908
"G.G. Dolls."

13:04.492 --> 13:06.952
This is the name of my mental power.

13:07.536 --> 13:08.871
Let's stack another book.

13:12.124 --> 13:13.542
You…

13:15.211 --> 13:17.588
You think you can cheat me like that?

13:18.130 --> 13:21.467
How dare you betray my trust.

13:23.093 --> 13:26.972
We're through!

13:27.056 --> 13:28.682
Just kidding!

13:28.766 --> 13:30.434
You passed, Chorokichi.

13:30.518 --> 13:33.187
Your shrewdness will prove useful.

13:33.270 --> 13:35.189
Very very good!

13:40.236 --> 13:41.070
Can you see?

13:41.695 --> 13:45.074
Down this corridor is the control room.

13:45.157 --> 13:47.952
The switch within that room

13:48.035 --> 13:50.496
can deactivate the locks in this facility.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.498
You can pass through.

13:53.165 --> 13:55.334
You see what I'm getting at.

13:55.417 --> 13:56.961
You are I are breaking out.

13:57.962 --> 14:00.297
For some reason, I can't shrink myself.

14:00.381 --> 14:02.258
But if we cooperate, we can leave.

14:02.341 --> 14:04.009
We need to trust each other.

14:04.093 --> 14:07.304
Of course, we'll need
to concoct a more reliable plan.

14:07.388 --> 14:11.267
First, I want you to check out
everything beyond this corridor.

14:12.601 --> 14:14.520
Do you really think we can escape?

14:15.563 --> 14:18.774
I told you to squeak like a rat!

14:21.527 --> 14:23.028
Squeak, how do I get

14:23.112 --> 14:25.531
to the control room, squeak?

14:25.614 --> 14:29.118
How cute! How precious.

14:29.618 --> 14:31.829
But how should I know, dumbass?

14:31.912 --> 14:34.707
That's why you're on this mission.

14:34.790 --> 14:35.875
Look up.

14:35.958 --> 14:37.376
That's the surveillance camera.

14:37.459 --> 14:39.587
But it can't see below this bar.

14:40.170 --> 14:41.505
Walk under the handrail.

14:42.631 --> 14:43.966
Put your hood on.

14:52.683 --> 14:54.101
Now go!

15:05.988 --> 15:07.406
Hey, you. What are you doing?

15:07.990 --> 15:10.242
That's right, you with the headband.

15:10.951 --> 15:12.870
State your name and number!

15:13.412 --> 15:15.539
FE18081.

15:15.623 --> 15:19.209
My name is Gwess.
I'm just loitering around.

15:19.293 --> 15:21.503
If you have no business here, then leave!

15:21.587 --> 15:22.588
Leave immediately.

15:23.464 --> 15:25.215
Sure thing, Mr. Prison Guard.

15:33.307 --> 15:38.062
There are four steel doors.
Which one is the control room?

15:38.145 --> 15:40.981
Also, there are two cameras here.

15:42.483 --> 15:44.985
What's going on? I'm running out of space.

15:45.778 --> 15:46.862
What's happening?

15:51.158 --> 15:52.284
Did you hear that?

15:52.785 --> 15:54.411
Yes, I heard it too.

15:54.995 --> 15:55.829
It was close by.

15:57.748 --> 15:59.083
My body…

15:59.667 --> 16:01.001
It's getting larger!

16:01.585 --> 16:02.962
The coffee's ready.

16:03.045 --> 16:05.005
Maybe it was from the coffee maker.

16:05.089 --> 16:07.675
-It didn't sound like it.
-This is bad. What's going on?

16:08.509 --> 16:09.343
Distance?

16:10.803 --> 16:12.346
Is it because Gwess is far from me?

16:12.972 --> 16:14.807
Is this ability affected by distance?

16:16.684 --> 16:18.018
I heard it again!

16:18.102 --> 16:19.228
Something's lurking nearby!

16:19.311 --> 16:20.980
Shit!

16:22.106 --> 16:24.566
It's right under there!
Hey, move out of the way!

16:24.650 --> 16:25.693
I said move it!

16:27.444 --> 16:29.822
That's hot!

16:29.905 --> 16:32.366
What the hell, man?

16:33.867 --> 16:34.827
What the…

16:35.411 --> 16:38.205
I told you it was from the coffee maker!

16:38.288 --> 16:39.289
My bad.

16:41.083 --> 16:42.668
This investigation is over!

16:42.751 --> 16:45.838
I need to get back before I get too big!

16:52.469 --> 16:53.887
What is that?

16:54.430 --> 16:57.808
G.G. Dolls!

17:06.942 --> 17:08.527
This monster…

17:25.794 --> 17:29.339
This monster…
It resembles a doll, but it's transparent.

17:29.423 --> 17:32.426
It's just like my thread.
Others can't see it.

17:32.509 --> 17:34.344
It's the materialization
of Gwess's ability.

17:34.845 --> 17:36.680
"G.G. Dolls."

17:37.181 --> 17:39.141
This is the name of my mental power.

17:40.100 --> 17:42.227
It shrank me

17:42.311 --> 17:44.313
and tore the prison guard to shreds!

17:46.648 --> 17:49.985
This shithead was inside the rat with me!

17:50.944 --> 17:52.029
And Gwess.

17:52.112 --> 17:54.865
She didn't know that
the ability would get deactivated.

17:54.948 --> 17:57.242
My body is returning to its original size.

17:57.326 --> 18:01.955
This monster thinks I'm ditching,
so he's here for a hunt!

18:02.039 --> 18:05.042
Not only that,
he wants to completely kill me!

18:10.881 --> 18:13.842
-G.G. Dolls!
-Shit!

18:14.635 --> 18:16.887
Why is this happening to me?

18:17.387 --> 18:19.848
Am I going to get killed
by a monster like him?

18:22.643 --> 18:23.727
I'm stuck!

18:57.928 --> 18:59.138
Threads.

18:59.221 --> 19:00.472
A bundle of threads.

19:04.017 --> 19:06.270
This must be the shape of my energy.

19:06.353 --> 19:07.437
Its form!

19:08.647 --> 19:11.400
The yarn weaves into its form.

19:11.483 --> 19:12.860
Hey, monster!

19:16.113 --> 19:17.990
Scream, you shithead!

19:18.073 --> 19:19.366
Get Gwess.

19:19.449 --> 19:20.492
Hurry!

19:20.576 --> 19:21.577
Jolyne…

19:22.578 --> 19:25.414
Turns out you have an ability.

19:25.497 --> 19:26.498
Gwess!

19:27.708 --> 19:28.709
Stop!

19:28.792 --> 19:32.087
Don't hurt my precious G.G. Dolls!

19:32.171 --> 19:33.255
Shut up!

19:33.338 --> 19:36.049
Make my body smaller so I can escape!

19:36.133 --> 19:37.926
Just by a bit, though, got it?

19:38.010 --> 19:41.013
All right, you can sleep on
the bottom bunk bed!

19:41.096 --> 19:43.891
Please don't hate me despite
what happened between us!

19:44.641 --> 19:47.603
But please squeak every once in a while.

19:47.686 --> 19:49.855
Just hurry it up!

19:52.441 --> 19:53.275
Finally.

19:53.901 --> 19:55.277
Now, the charm.

19:55.360 --> 19:58.655
Give me the stone
and tell me who sold it to you.

19:59.323 --> 20:00.866
Of course.

20:00.949 --> 20:02.409
Two hundred dollars, was it--

20:02.492 --> 20:04.411
Shut up, bitch!

20:04.494 --> 20:05.913
Tell me who sold it to you!

20:05.996 --> 20:07.456
All right.

20:07.539 --> 20:10.584
Some woman named Ermes sold it to me.

20:10.667 --> 20:11.793
Ermes?

20:11.877 --> 20:13.795
I don't know much about her.

20:14.296 --> 20:15.130
Here.

20:21.386 --> 20:22.763
Well…

20:27.267 --> 20:28.852
I got her!

20:28.936 --> 20:31.647
Guards! We have a problem!

20:31.730 --> 20:34.691
This bitch here crossed the gun point!

20:34.775 --> 20:36.735
Come here, quick!

20:37.736 --> 20:40.239
What are you doing there?

20:41.949 --> 20:43.242
How did you get over there?

20:46.328 --> 20:47.162
Jailbreak!

20:47.871 --> 20:49.164
Code 999!

20:53.168 --> 20:55.045
It's all over for you now.

20:55.128 --> 20:58.173
The prison guard
is retrieving the shotgun as we speak.

20:58.257 --> 21:01.009
He has every right to shoot you down!

21:01.093 --> 21:02.761
No questions asked!

21:03.262 --> 21:04.972
Jolyne!

21:05.055 --> 21:06.682
Serves you right!

21:06.765 --> 21:09.768
It's what you get
for trampling on my heart!

21:11.937 --> 21:14.481
Good grief, Gwess.

21:14.564 --> 21:17.859
You said everything has a name.

21:18.360 --> 21:20.112
I'll name this ability of mine too.

21:20.654 --> 21:22.197
"Stone Ocean."

21:22.281 --> 21:25.325
I'll become free
from this ocean of stones.

21:25.993 --> 21:27.035
Did you hear me?

21:27.619 --> 21:30.539
Stone Ocean. That's the name.

21:39.673 --> 21:43.677
If there's a hierarchy system
in this prison, I'll follow it.

21:43.760 --> 21:45.971
However, I'm the one who gives orders.

21:46.596 --> 21:49.516
Now let me cross over.

21:50.809 --> 21:53.770
-What?
-Where is she?

21:55.063 --> 21:57.149
-She disappeared.
-What?

21:57.232 --> 21:58.942
Are you sure she was there?

21:59.443 --> 22:01.528
Well, I just saw her back, so…

22:02.112 --> 22:03.238
Strange…

22:13.832 --> 22:14.750
Dad…

23:41.211 --> 23:46.216
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
